:: OC Snowpaw Beach Theft [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 30>>
You are walking along the edge of the beach when you hear some commotion coming from the locker rooms. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What they fuck!? Where did they go!? That fucking brat!”</span> A man yells as he and about 3 other buff bodybuilders come out red in the face with anger <span style="color:Pink">wearing only towels. They glance around in frustration, gripping their towels tightly as a police officer walks over.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sirs, you cannot be using such language here. Children are present.”</span> The police officer scolds. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Some brat stole our clothes!”</span> The center dude says angrily as the rest nod along. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“He was dressed like some sort of bandit or something! I demand you arrest him!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“A bandit?”</span> The police officer raises an eyebrow, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Well, I haven’t seen any ‘bandits’ around here. Are you sure you didn’t just misplace them?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Misplace!? You think we ALL misplaced our clothes!?”</span> He man turns red in the face, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We saw him poking around and he ran out carrying a bag! It must have been him! Aren’t you going to do anything!?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“If you think your property had been stolen, you can file a report. But unless you have any real evidence, I cannot arrest anybody, no.”</span> The police officer glances around the beach, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“And like I said, I don’t even see any ‘bandits’ or anything like that. So, who exactly am I arresting? Do you have a description outside of ‘wild west wear’?”</span> The men all grumble and argue, angry that their clothes were stolen, and this officer seems more annoyed than helpful. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hehehe…”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You hear a chucking nearby and turn to see a bandit, or at least a kid dressed as one, hiding behind a parked car with a bag flung over his shoulders.</span> <span style="color:Pink">Even with his mask, you quickly identify the boy as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span>, the mischievous nudist who no doubt stole those men’s clothes. <span style="color:Pink">You just watch with amusement as the four buff men are left with no choice but to walk back to their hotel in just their towels. It is rather amusing.</span> </span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Snowpaw",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Bandit",
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Mad",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:Pink">But it seems the clothing bandito is not finished, as once the police officer is gone and the men are walking by the parking lot, he strikes!</span> He hides the bag of their clothing under the car and, moving like the wind, dashes past them all! <span style="color:Pink">They don’t even realize what happened at first, a white blur moving past them as the small boy reaches out and snatches each one of their towels in perfect sync. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span> keeps running, giggling away as he holds up their towels.</span> <br>
<br>

<<if $Player.Kinks.Adults == 1>>
    <span style="color:Pink">You blush and smile at the sight. The largest man, buff and intimidating, seems to not be blessed when it comes to down there. Two of the other men seem to be rather blessed, though you find it cute that one of them has shaved every inch of hair down there. The last man is of average size, but has a funny <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Mom”</span> tattoo on his butt that really takes away the intimidating factor he was going for when yelling at that police officer.</span> <br>
    <<set $Arousal += 20>>
    <br>
<</if>>

<span style="color:Pink">The men, confused briefly, don’t notice what he’s done until they see him running off, towels in hand. They then all realize in unison that they are now butt naked in the middle of the parking lot! Cries of embarrassment, yells of anger, and swears fill the air as all four naked dudes chase after the much faster boy. It is a hilarious sight that gives you and the few other witnesses a good laugh as the men can do nothing to catch the boy or retrieve their clothes. They’ll be in for a rather embarrassing walk home. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span>, meanwhile, probably figures he is doing them a favor and liberating them from the shackles of clothing and society. You don’t think the nude men see it that way, but you aren’t complaining.</span> <br>
<<needChange "Fun" 5>>
